て非常にセクシーな賢者になったニノをリクエストします。\n具体的には身長も伸び、スタイルもよくなり、例えばブルーニャやソーニャのような感じの大人な女性になって、豪華でセクシーなドレスに身を包んだ姿を書いて欲しいです。\n\nその他ポーズやシチュエーションなど細かいことはお任せします。\n\nお気に召しましたらよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@245_15277297/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e7f374f/uploads/origins/b9e10981-5be1-43d1-b254-f64f5ea30ca7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=210d5a8b86282ddfcfdf0049ad4ce601", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e7f374f/uploads/origins/b9e10981-5be1-43d1-b254-f64f5ea30ca7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=210d5a8b86282ddfcfdf0049ad4ce601, https://si.imgix.net/8e7f374f/uploads/origins/b9e10981-5be1-43d1-b254-f64f5ea30ca7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5e35c2e569de834640c62fa1f6ec302c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e7f374f/uploads/origins/b9e10981-5be1-43d1-b254-f64f5ea30ca7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e15e371953dc08c3590aa5c3d3a264dd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art is so very cute! Would you please draw my FFXIV character? She is gentle, shy and quiet, enjoys gardening, tea,  and nature. I really love your cute style and bright colors.\n \nHere are some other outfits for you to choose from: https://imgur.com/a/JxRaegS\n\nPlease have fun! Thank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/D3B74Na", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@245_15277297/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c434ca72/uploads/origins/7e817346-372d-415d-831e-53267573c0e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c203feeb2176f20f889a836788efb8e3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c434ca72/uploads/origins/7e817346-372d-415d-831e-53267573c0e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c203feeb2176f20f889a836788efb8e3, https://si.imgix.net/c434ca72/uploads/origins/7e817346-372d-415d-8